WEBVTT

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.094
Guys, this is Susan.

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:11.178
Hey.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:14.973
Is she your hostage?

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:19.311
No! She's my girlfriend. [giggles]

00:00:19.395 --> 00:00:20.896
[crowd cheers]

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.107
[all laugh]

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.150
[Piranha] She called him Snakey Cakes!

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:27.569
[Susan] Ah.

00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:30.030
So these are the roommates.

00:00:30.114 --> 00:00:33.200
Roommates?
Did you say roommates?

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:36.078
Hey, I'm pulling your whiskers, Whiskers.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.580
Snakey here told me all about you guys.

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:41.125
Wait, wait. I'm just trying
to do the math here.

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.836
You're with Snake on purpose?

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:48.006
[chuckles] Well, you talk pretty tough
for a mango with teeth.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:50.634
What? Is that what I look like?

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:54.930
Ooh, she is spicy. I like it.
Insult me next.

00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:58.100
Ha, ha!

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.520
Are you ready to dance?

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:02.771
[growls]

00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:04.440
[screams]

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:10.070
Another victory for Handsome Jorge!

00:01:10.154 --> 00:01:11.363
[crowd] Jorge! Jorge! Jorge!

00:01:11.447 --> 00:01:14.032
No one can defeat my handsomeness.

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:21.081
And now, bring down
The Belt of Guatelamango!

00:01:21.165 --> 00:01:22.958
-[dramatic guitar plays]
-Oh, my gosh! It's the belt!

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.793
Give me that belt! Give me that belt!

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:25.919
I love it!

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.797
Wait a minute. Fans...

00:01:28.881 --> 00:01:29.923
Shh!

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:33.761
Can it be? Yes!

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:36.597
It looks like we have a new challenger!

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.557
[steps thudding]

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:45.147
Someone has a death wish big enough
to take on Handsome Jorge!

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:48.233
[crowd chanting] Jorge! Jorge! Jorge!

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:49.985
Jorge! Jorge!

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:51.320
[gulps]

00:01:52.613 --> 00:01:53.906
Of course.

00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:56.241
What better way to steal
the belt than to win it?

00:01:56.325 --> 00:01:58.118
That's the Phantom Bandit!

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:02.706
Ha, ha! So, you want that belt, huh?

00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:04.750
We gotta expose him.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.376
How are we supposed to do that?

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.878
We improvise.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.964
Well, come and get it, pig-- [chokes]

00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:13.801
Wow! He means business!

00:02:13.884 --> 00:02:15.385
Yeah!

00:02:15.469 --> 00:02:17.346
-Can we talk about this?
-[snorts]

00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:24.186
This is wrestling at its best!

00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:25.354
Not the face!

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.900
[crowd gasps]

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.487
I didn't really think that through.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:35.656
Uh-oh!

00:02:39.535 --> 00:02:40.953
[dramatic music plays]

00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:42.913
-Huh?
-[both grunt]

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:45.666
-['The Chicken Dance" plays]
-Ooh!

00:02:48.377 --> 00:02:50.796
You ever been deboned
by a chicken?

00:02:51.338 --> 00:02:56.260
Who's ready for some violence?

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.555
Violence!

00:02:59.638 --> 00:03:01.932
Violence! Yes!

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:03.809
Guys, go for the mask!

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:04.935
["I Like It" playing]

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:17.698
-[yells]
-[screams] Spider!

00:03:19.241 --> 00:03:20.909
Now the mask! Go for the mask!

00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:30.419
[music continues]

00:03:39.511 --> 00:03:40.679
[laughing]

00:03:44.266 --> 00:03:46.268
Snake attack! [snarls]

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.021
Wait!

00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:50.230
-[screams]
-[grunts]

00:03:53.317 --> 00:03:54.318
[grunts]

00:03:54.401 --> 00:03:55.694
Great.

00:03:55.777 --> 00:03:57.362
[roars]

00:03:58.071 --> 00:03:59.531
All together now!

00:04:05.954 --> 00:04:07.289
[groans]

00:04:07.372 --> 00:04:08.498
[music ends]

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:14.171
Ladies and gentlemen,
this is no Luchador.

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:16.340
It's the Phantom Bandit.

00:04:16.423 --> 00:04:18.425
-[crowd groans]
-[Snake chuckles]

00:04:18.508 --> 00:04:21.553
She came here to steal the...

00:04:21.637 --> 00:04:22.638
the...

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:24.264
belt?

00:04:24.848 --> 00:04:26.934
Good luck getting out of
this one, Bad Guys.

00:04:27.017 --> 00:04:28.060
Huh?

00:04:28.143 --> 00:04:29.144
What?

00:04:29.645 --> 00:04:31.146
Uh-oh.

00:04:31.647 --> 00:04:34.274
-It's the Bad Guys!
-They're stealing the belt!

00:04:37.903 --> 00:04:39.154
Let's get them!

00:04:39.237 --> 00:04:40.238
[crowd screams]

00:04:40.322 --> 00:04:41.823
Run!

00:04:41.907 --> 00:04:43.158
[crowd] Get them!

00:04:45.535 --> 00:04:46.954
Piranha, will you take off the belt?

00:04:47.037 --> 00:04:48.538
-I can't get it off!
-Take off the belt!

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:50.499
[screaming]

00:04:50.582 --> 00:04:53.418
My belt! My belt! Get 'em!

00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:54.503
[Luggins grunting]

00:04:59.466 --> 00:05:00.467
[crowd] Get them!

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:01.843
-Chief!
-Don't let them escape!

00:05:01.927 --> 00:05:03.387
It's not what it looks like!

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:04.805
Get the belt!

00:05:04.888 --> 00:05:06.890
I-- I trusted you!

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:11.186
[growls]

00:05:14.564 --> 00:05:16.566
People! We've got a code 12!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.861
Bad Guys are the Bandits! Mobilize!

00:05:19.945 --> 00:05:20.988
[officer on radio] Yes, maam.

00:05:25.575 --> 00:05:27.202
-Uh-oh.
-What do we do now?

00:05:27.285 --> 00:05:28.495
[Luggins] Wolf!

00:05:35.377 --> 00:05:36.461
Get in!

00:05:36.545 --> 00:05:38.422
You heard the bird. Get in!

00:05:41.675 --> 00:05:43.218
Go, go!

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:50.058
Wow, that was close.

00:05:50.142 --> 00:05:51.893
[Bad Guys scream]

00:05:51.977 --> 00:05:55.522
Stop this truck now!

00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:57.816
Hold on, folks!

00:05:59.526 --> 00:06:00.777
[screams]

00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:03.113
Wolf!

00:06:03.655 --> 00:06:04.865
Sorry.

00:06:06.283 --> 00:06:07.743
[music ends]

00:06:12.247 --> 00:06:13.957
Isn't she great?

00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:16.501
[Luggins] Bad Guys.

00:06:16.585 --> 00:06:18.587
-[sirens blaring]
-Ugh.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.672
I'm getting too old for this.

00:06:20.756 --> 00:06:21.798
[groans]

00:06:21.882 --> 00:06:23.467
All units. All units.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.219
Suspects are headed east
in a hot dog truck.

00:06:26.303 --> 00:06:27.471
[on radio] Can you be more specific?

00:06:27.554 --> 00:06:30.223
Um, it looks to be all beef,
possibly chorizo.

00:06:30.307 --> 00:06:33.101
I need birds in the sky,
roadblocks every five miles.

00:06:33.185 --> 00:06:35.687
I want eyes on every motel, greasy spoon,

00:06:35.771 --> 00:06:36.855
gas station, bus station,

00:06:36.938 --> 00:06:40.817
cattle station, mole hole, vole hole
and watering hole within 80 miles.

00:06:40.901 --> 00:06:41.985
Let's go!

00:06:43.779 --> 00:06:45.489
Now it's personal.

00:06:52.204 --> 00:06:53.622
They fell for it.

00:06:53.705 --> 00:06:55.082
Just like you planned, boss.

00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:56.875
[voice] Good. Let's go.

